{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122295","id":4252141602,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc79cogi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122295","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122295.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122295.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122295","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122295/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122295/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122295/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/20c2de078fd7970f711e0e66252e833a1cfe8fc2","number":122295,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Switch `CowData::_insert_uninitialized` to a type erased implementation","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Reduces binary size at the time of writing (Fedora 44):\r\n  - `scons target=template_release production=yes` -> Roughly 260kb\r\n  - `scons target=editor production=yes` -> Roughly 450kb\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nPreviously `_insert_uninitialized` was specialized for all types with which cow data (Vector) was specialized.\r\n\r\nThis PR delegates to a helper method that is only templated based on the size of the type (and if the type is not trivially copyable, the type as well to support forking). So a lot of CowData specializations can share the same implementation of `_insert_uninitialized`.\r\n\r\nBased on my (limited) understanding of the code the only possible performance impact would be from code locality. Since I worked on this as a learning exercise my testing has been limited to the unit tests for now.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>\r\nAI Disclosure\r\n</summary>\r\n\r\nAll code in this PR is hand written. However before doing that I used a Copilot POC to validate that my idea on how template bloat could be reduced was correct. I never looked at the LLM results beyond building them and comparing sizes.\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"stat